{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>凌晨1時40分，警方接獲駕駛人士報案指，一輛私家車沿連翔道往尖沙咀方向近西九龍站對開，懷疑失控撞及左邊石壆，繼而四輪朝天翻側，司機被困。救援人員接報到場，男司機在途經貨車司機協助下已自行爬出，男事主手腳擦傷，現場接受治理後拒絕送院，警方正調查意外原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.568380+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:23:19.181710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:51.523490+00:00","content_hash":"3ad4a9db5d6422a27b14dcc3dc2d9f18504525e2fbb12ee1d2e72388d6d76657","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}